        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Texas Architect — Page 22</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f2efe9;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f6f3ee;\n    padding: 40px 30px 20px 30px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    border-left: 6px solid #2b2b2b;\n    border-right: 6px solid #2b2b2b;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    width: 62%;\n    padding-right: 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    width: 0;\n    border-left: 2px solid #333;\n    margin: 0 18px;\n  }\n  .col-right {\n    width: 34%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* Left column elements */\n  .top-box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    height: 78px;\n    margin-bottom: 130px;\n  }\n  .credits {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin-left: 60px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .credits b { font-weight: bold; }\n  .credits .indent { display: inline-block; margin-left: 130px; }\n  .photo {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #bbb;\n    height: 560px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .headline {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 34px 0 30px 0;\n    transform: scaleX(0.92);\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 17.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .body-text p { margin: 0 0 0 0; text-indent: 26px; }\n  .logo-steel {\n    float: left;\n    width: 105px;\n    height: 105px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 3px solid #111;\n    margin: 4px 14px 6px 55px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .sc { font-variant: small-caps; }\n  .armco-line {\n    margin-top: 70px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 30px;\n  }\n  .armco-mark {\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0 auto 4px auto;\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border: 3px solid #111;\n    border-bottom: none;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .armco-mark:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 22px;\n    top: 43px;\n    width: 0; height: 0;\n    border-left: 38px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 38px solid transparent;\n    border-top: 34px solid #111;\n  }\n  .bottom-box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    height: 90px;\n    margin-top: 90px;\n  }\n\n  /* Right column */\n  .ad-box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 28px 14px 34px 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .ad-italic {\n    font-family: \"Century Gothic\", \"Futura\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .ad-title {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    margin: 30px 0 26px 0;\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .ad-sub {\n    font-family: \"Century Gothic\", \"Futura\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    margin: 0 0 44px 0;\n  }\n  .ad-city {\n    font-family: \"Century Gothic\", \"Futura\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 27px;\n  }\n  .nt-head {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 70px 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .nt-text {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .nt-text p { margin: 0 0 26px 0; }\n  .spaced { letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .endmark {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 11px; height: 11px;\n    background: #111;\n    float: right;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"top-box\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"credits\">\n        <b>Owner:</b> Citizens National Bank, Beaumont, Texas<br>\n        <b>Associated Architects:</b> Moore and Stansbury, Port Arthur, Texas, and<br>\n        <span class=\"indent\">George L. Ingram &amp; Associates, Beaumont, Texas</span><br>\n        <b>Armco Dealer:</b> Norstok Steel Building Co., Orange, Texas\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"photo placeholder\">[Photograph: night view of Citizens National Bank branch building with illuminated sign]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"headline\">Construction time&ndash;60 days</div>\n\n      <div class=\"body-text\">\n        <div class=\"logo-steel placeholder\">[Logo: Steel<br>emblem]</div>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;\">Impossible? Not at all, with the Armco Building System. Tellers moved in 60 days after construction began on this branch bank.</p>\n        <p>In addition to gaining quick occupancy, the owners can rely on this 56- by 110- by 10-foot Armco Building to stay attractive and structurally sound for decades to come. One reason is the standing-seam rib roof of <span class=\"sc\">Steelox</span><sup>&reg;</sup> Panels &ndash; the most weathertight, maintenance-free system available.</p>\n        <p>Let an Armco Sales Engineer quote costs and completion dates for <i>your</i> building. Or write Metal Products Division, Armco Steel Corporation, P. O. Box 1939, Houston, Texas 77001. Offices also in Austin, Dallas and San Antonio.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"armco-line\">\n        <span class=\"armco-mark placeholder\"></span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Arial Black',Arial,sans-serif;\">ARMCO</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Metal Products Division</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bottom-box\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"ad-box\">\n        <div class=\"ad-italic\">\n          If you have something Special . . .<br>\n          . . . and want it done Right<br>\n          Send it to . . .\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ad-title\">Texas Timbers, Inc.</div>\n        <div class=\"ad-sub\">Laminated Timbers</div>\n        <div class=\"ad-city\">LaGrange, Texas</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"nt-head\">\n        NATIONAL TRUST<br>\n        FOR HISTORIC<br>\n        PRESERVATION\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"nt-text\">\n        <p>Nine slide <span class=\"spaced\">lectures</span> with prepared texts will be available September 1, 1966, from the National Trust for Historic Preservation. The lectures feature the American preservation movement, seven Trust-owned historic house museums open to the public, and The White House.</p>\n\n        <p>Approximately 50 <span class=\"spaced\">color slides</span> will illustrate each 30-minute reading text, together providing historical and architectural background on each subject surveyed. A $3 rental fee will be charged for each set of lecture text and slides, lent for a two-week period.</p>\n\n        <p>For a descriptive brochure on the lecture series, write the National Trust for Historic Preservation, 815-17th Street, N.W., Washington, D. C., 20006.</p>\n\n        <p>The National Trust is a private, non-profit organization, chartered by Congress and directed to assist in the preservation of sites, buildings and objects of significance in American history and culture. <span class=\"endmark\"></span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div>22</div>\n    <div><i>TEXAS ARCHITECT</i></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
